    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59038" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κοραγεῖν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀνάγειν τὴν Κόρην</span> (sc.
		Persephone), <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κοράγια</span></b> , τά, of a ritual procession
		at Mantinea, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			5(2).265.16
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κοράγιον</span></b> , τό, sanctuary where this
		rite took place, ib.<i><span class="en">
			266.41
		</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κοραγοί</span></b> , οἱ, celebrants of the rite, ib.<i><span class="en">
			265.27
		</span></i>.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
